---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="devTuna 소개"
  description="Tuna Sweeper 개발사 devTuna의 공식 로고 인트로 영상"
  activeSlug="devtuna"
>
  <article class="devtuna-page">
    <header class="devtuna-hero">
      <span>DEVELOPER · LOGO INTRO</span>
      <h1>dev<span>Tuna</span></h1>
      <p>Tuna Sweeper 개발사 devTuna의 로고 인트로 영상입니다.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="devtuna-stage" aria-labelledby="devtuna-video-title">
      <div class="devtuna-video-frame">
        <video
          controls
          autoplay
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          preload="metadata"
          poster="/videos/devtuna-logo-intro-poster.webp"
          width="854"
          height="480"
          aria-describedby="devtuna-video-note"
        >
          <source src="/videos/devtuna-logo-intro.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <source src="/videos/devtuna-logo-intro.mov" type="video/quicktime" />
          브라우저에서 영상을 재생할 수 없습니다.
        </video>
      </div>

      <div class="devtuna-details">
        <div>
          <span>OFFICIAL IDENT</span>
          <h2 id="devtuna-video-title">고양이와 참치의 10초 인트로</h2>
          <p id="devtuna-video-note">낚싯대를 든 고양이와 참치가 devTuna 워드마크로 이어지는 개발사 로고 애니메이션입니다.</p>
        </div>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>재생 시간</dt><dd>10초</dd></div>
          <div><dt>화면</dt><dd>854 × 480 · 24fps</dd></div>
          <div><dt>원본</dt><dd>H.264 · AAC · MOV</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="devtuna-download" href="/videos/devtuna-logo-intro.mov" download>원본 MOV 다운로드 ↓</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .devtuna-page{background:#000;color:#fff;min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden}.devtuna-hero{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(68px,10vw,130px) clamp(24px,6vw,72px) 58px;text-align:center}.devtuna-hero>span,.devtuna-details>div>span{font:700 9px Inter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#77b9e6}.devtuna-hero h1{margin:25px 0 18px;font:600 clamp(64px,11vw,144px)/.92 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.075em}.devtuna-hero h1 span{color:#55aee7}.devtuna-hero p{margin:0 auto;max-width:560px;font-family:'Gowun Dodum',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,21px);line-height:1.65;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}.devtuna-stage{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,66px) clamp(80px,11vw,150px)}.devtuna-video-frame{padding:clamp(8px,1.2vw,14px);background:#151515;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 34px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.58);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}.devtuna-video-frame video{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:854/480;background:#fff;border-radius:10px}.devtuna-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(220px,.42fr);gap:36px 72px;padding:46px 4px 0;align-items:start}.devtuna-details h2{font-family:'Gowun Dodum',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,46px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.2;margin:14px 0 15px}.devtuna-details p{max-width:650px;margin:0;font-family:'Gowun Dodum',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:rgba(255,255,255,.62)}.devtuna-details dl{margin:2px 0 0}.devtuna-details dl>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}.devtuna-details dl>div:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}.devtuna-details dt,.devtuna-details dd{margin:0;font:600 10px Inter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em}.devtuna-details dt{color:rgba(255,255,255,.46)}.devtuna-details dd{text-align:right;color:rgba(255,255,255,.84)}.devtuna-download{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:start;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 19px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.32);border-radius:999px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;transition:.2s ease}.devtuna-download:hover{background:#fff;color:#111;border-color:#fff}.devtuna-download:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #55aee7;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:720px){.devtuna-hero{padding:58px 22px 38px}.devtuna-hero h1{font-size:64px}.devtuna-stage{padding:0 14px 78px}.devtuna-video-frame{border-radius:12px;padding:6px}.devtuna-video-frame video{border-radius:7px}.devtuna-details{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;padding:34px 8px 0}.devtuna-details h2{font-size:30px}.devtuna-download{grid-column:auto}}
</style>
